# Copy to .dev.vars (gitignored) for local `wrangler dev`.
# M0 has no secrets yet — populated as later milestones add them (see docs/08-DEPLOYMENT.md §3).

# M3 — Better Auth (docs/05 §10). Any non-empty string works for local dev;
# rotating it invalidates every session.
BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=dev-only-change-me

# M3 — Turnstile (docs/05 §8). Optional: leave unset locally and the signup
# captcha check is skipped. Set to a real secret (and wire the matching
# VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY client-side) to exercise it end to end.
# TURNSTILE_SECRET=
